abstract: "Mosaic turns linear AI chat into an interactive tree on an infinite canvas. Supports branching conversations, multi-provider LLM integration (Mistral, OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Ollama), RAG with semantic search, inline code execution via WebAssembly, and glass UI theming."
